    publishes each NEW ban into the mesh via `annuairectl ban` (TTL = the
    crowdsec duration; reason = the scenario), idempotent via a state file. A
    timer runs it ~90s. Net: crowdsec detects on one node -> signed ban federates
    -> every peer enforces it in the secubox_meshban nft set -> auto-expires.
    Safe no-op where crowdsec is absent.

